  "_explored": {
    "date": "2026-10-08",
    "by": "Claude přes BrowserOS neo, admin Thomas Claver, UI cs",
    "notes": "v2: krátké kroky jako u absence (jedna věta = jedna akce), hlas Jana. Selektory ověřeny resolverem (count 1 / visible 1) a celý tok proklikán. Tlačítko se jmenuje 'Vytvořit nový report' (ne 'Vytvořit vlastní report' z help centra), záložky: Všechny reporty / Oblíbené / Vytvořeno mnou / Veřejný / Předpřipravené. Pohledy u absencí: Detailní / Shrnutí / Typy / Dny (zbývající fond). Export: Exportovat jako CSV / Exportovat jako Excel (.xlsx). Možnosti: Upravit název nebo popis / Přidat k oblíbeným / Smazat report. Odkaz presetu je v tabulce zalomený na dva řádky a rekordér kliká do středu bounding boxu (míjí) – proto hover + navigate na /app/custom-reports/579. Uložení reportu trvá na pre-produ 5–8 s. Před opakovaným natáčením smazat report 'Čerpání dovolené – přehled' (koš v seznamu nebo Možnosti → Smazat report)."
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "part": 1,
      "part_title": "Introduction",
      "narration": "How much leave do people have left, who's working overtime, and what should you send to the accountant? Hi, I'm Maria from the Sloneek team, and today I'll show you Custom reports.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a[href=\"/app/custom-reports\"]",
        "url_contains": "/app/dashboard"
      },
      "hold_after_ms": 400
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "narration": "You'll find reports at the very bottom of the left menu, under Custom reports.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a[href=\"/app/custom-reports\"]",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=mainNavigationDiv] a[href=\"/app/custom-reports\"]",
          "before_ms": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "2500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "h1:text-is(\"Custom reports\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/custom-reports"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "narration": "At the top, there are tabs: all reports, favorites, created by me, public, and pre-made. A pre-made report is ready to open, and you can adjust it if you need to.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": ".p-tablist-tab-list",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "3500"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "p-tab:text-is(\"Pre made\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "p-tab:text-is(\"Pre made\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/custom-reports"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "part": 2,
      "part_title": "Setup",
      "narration": "The module needs no setup. I'll open the Complex Salary Report.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "hover",
          "selector": "a[href=\"/app/custom-reports/579\"]",
          "before_ms": 1500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "navigate",
          "value": "https://app-pre-production.sloneek.com/app/custom-reports/579"
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "3500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "h1:text-is(\"Complex Salary Report\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/custom-reports/579"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "narration": "At the top, you choose the period, on the left the columns, and on the right you see the data right away.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "p-togglebutton:text-is(\"Last month\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"crDetail.sidebarTab.include-data\"]",
          "before_ms": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "zoom",
          "selector": "th[data-cy=\"crDetail.grid.header.employee_name\"]",
          "value": "1.4",
          "hold_ms": 1500,
          "before_ms": 600
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "th[data-cy=\"crDetail.grid.header.employee_name\"]",
        "url_contains": "/app/custom-reports/579"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "narration": "The report pulls data from absences, attendance, activities and user profiles, so the better you keep them up to date, the better your overview.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"crSidebar.header.absence\"]",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"crSidebar.header.attendance\"]",
          "before_ms": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"crSidebar.header.activity\"]",
          "before_ms": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"crSidebar.header.employee\"]",
          "before_ms": 900
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=\"crSidebar.header.absence\"]",
        "url_contains": "/app/custom-reports/579"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "part": 3,
      "part_title": "Example use",
      "narration": "Now let's build our own overview. Managers want to know how much leave people have left. I'll go back to the list.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "4500"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "button:text-is(\"Back\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "2000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "button:text-is(\"Create new report\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/custom-reports"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "narration": "I'll click Create new report and start with an empty table.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "button:text-is(\"Create new report\")",
          "before_ms": 700
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "3000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "h1:text-is(\"New report\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/custom-reports/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "narration": "Under Include data, I'll expand Absence.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"crDetail.sidebarTab.include-data\"]",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"crSidebar.header.absence\"]",
          "before_ms": 800
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1200"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=\"crSidebar.tabs.absence\"]",
        "url_contains": "/app/custom-reports/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "narration": "For absences, you can choose from four views: detailed, summary, types, and days with the remaining fund. I'll pick Summary, because I want claims and balances.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"crSidebar.tabs.absence\"] [role=combobox]",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "700"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": ".p-select-overlay",
          "before_ms": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "3800"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": ".p-select-overlay li[role=option]:text-is(\"Summary\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1200"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=\"crSidebar.col.absence_summary.absence_remaining_claim\"]",
        "url_contains": "/app/custom-reports/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "narration": "I'll tick the name, the final claim, the total claimed and the remaining claim. Each column shows up in the table right away.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"crSidebar.col.absence_summary.absence_name\"]",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "900"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"crSidebar.col.absence_summary.absence_final_claim\"]",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "900"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"crSidebar.col.absence_summary.absence_total_claimed\"]",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "900"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"crSidebar.col.absence_summary.absence_remaining_claim\"]",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "th[data-cy=\"crDetail.grid.header.absence_remaining_claim\"]",
        "url_contains": "/app/custom-reports/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "narration": "At the top, I'll switch the period to This year, so the numbers match the annual allowance.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "p-togglebutton:text-is(\"This year\")",
          "before_ms": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "2500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "th[data-cy=\"crDetail.grid.header.absence_remaining_claim\"]",
        "url_contains": "/app/custom-reports/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "narration": "The table now shows all absence types. Watch out for a common mistake: ticking a column doesn't filter the data, it only displays it. The filter is the icon in the column header.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "2500"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"crSidebar.col.employee.employee_active\"]",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "2500"
        },
        {
          "type": "zoom",
          "selector": "th[data-cy=\"crDetail.grid.header.absence_name\"]",
          "value": "1.5",
          "hold_ms": 1800
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=\"crDetail.grid.filterIcon.absence_name\"]",
        "url_contains": "/app/custom-reports/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "narration": "I'll click it next to the name, select the vacation type, and confirm with Apply.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"crDetail.grid.filterIcon.absence_name\"]",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"crDetail.grid.filter.list.value.absence_name\"]",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": ".p-multiselect-overlay li[role=option]:text-is(\"Dovolená\")",
          "before_ms": 400
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "500"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"crDetail.grid.filter.list.value.absence_name\"]",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "400"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=\"crDetail.grid.filterFooter.apply\"] button",
          "before_ms": 500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "2500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "tbody td:text-is(\"Dovolená\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/custom-reports/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "narration": "In the top right corner, I'll click Save report.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "button:text-is(\"Save report\")",
          "before_ms": 800
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1500"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=nameInput]",
        "url_contains": "/app/custom-reports/new"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "narration": "I'll name it Leave usage, overview, add a short description, and tick Make report public, so other admins can see it too. Then I'll save it.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "type",
          "selector": "[data-cy=nameInput]",
          "value": "Leave usage – overview",
          "clear": true,
          "speed": "fast",
          "before_ms": 300
        },
        {
          "type": "fill",
          "selector": "[data-cy=descriptionTextarea]",
          "value": "Remaining leave for all colleagues this year.",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=isPublicCheckbox]",
          "before_ms": 900
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=saveButton] button",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "9000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "h1:text-is(\"Leave usage – overview\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/custom-reports/"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "narration": "Send the finished report to your accountant or management with the Export button. You can choose Excel or CSV, and only the filtered data is exported.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "[data-cy=reportExportButton] button",
          "before_ms": 1500
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "900"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": ".p-menu-overlay",
          "before_ms": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "2500"
        },
        {
          "type": "press",
          "value": "Escape"
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "600"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "[data-cy=reportExportButton] button",
        "url_contains": "/app/custom-reports/"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "part": 4,
      "part_title": "Who sees the report",
      "narration": "And who will see the report? Other admins will find a public report in the Public tab. A manager only sees their own team, and an employee only their own data.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "button:text-is(\"Back\")",
          "before_ms": 1200
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "2000"
        },
        {
          "type": "click",
          "selector": "p-tab:text-is(\"Public\")",
          "before_ms": 600
        },
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1500"
        },
        {
          "type": "highlight",
          "selector": "a:text-is(\"Leave usage – overview\")",
          "before_ms": 300
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "a:text-is(\"Leave usage – overview\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/custom-reports"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "part": 5,
      "part_title": "Wrap-up",
      "narration": "And that's it. You can now open a pre-made report, build your own, filter it, save it and export it. One last tip: in the Advanced tab, you can group and total your data.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "h1:text-is(\"Custom reports\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/custom-reports"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s20",
      "narration": "If something doesn't work, check the Help Center. Less admin, more time for people. This is Sloneek.",
      "actions": [
        {
          "type": "wait",
          "value": "1000"
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "visible": "h1:text-is(\"Custom reports\")",
        "url_contains": "/app/custom-reports"
      },
      "hold_after_ms": 1500
    }
